{"concept":"lion","groups":[{"id":"source-use","name":{"ru":"Употребления в речи, образе и действии","en":"Uses in speech, image and action"},"count":27}],"occurrences":[{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.01","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-8a460a186f11c8b579352889ccd69abd","tos.text-unit.sid-8a460a186f11c8b579352889ccd69abd"]},"form":"Löwe","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"people","mode":"speech","use":"question","group":"source-use","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Заратустра спрашивает, добивается ли разум знания, как лев пищи.","en":"Zarathustra asks whether reason strives for knowledge as the lion for food."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.02","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-32dbfb5bbf74851f8e864356790d227e","tos.text-unit.sid-32dbfb5bbf74851f8e864356790d227e"]},"form":"Löwen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"source-use","neighbours":["child","becoming","camel","three-metamorphoses","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Три превращения ведут дух от верблюда через льва к дитяти.","en":"Three metamorphoses lead the spirit from camel through lion to child."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.02","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-9089a1d79a3475324bf27fde5b1eb037","tos.text-unit.sid-9089a1d79a3475324bf27fde5b1eb037"]},"form":"Löwen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"source-use","neighbours":["will","becoming","loneliness","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Дух-лев добывает свободу в собственной пустыне.","en":"The lion-spirit wins freedom in its own desert."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.02","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-dc8655dfae1632e8941021cb8aac7253","tos.text-unit.sid-dc8655dfae1632e8941021cb8aac7253"]},"form":"Löwen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"source-use","neighbours":["will","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Лев говорит «я хочу» перед драконом «ты должен».","en":"The lion says “I will” before the dragon’s “thou shalt.”"}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.02","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-77f079fe516bfeb5acfac8e3ddbc7199","tos.text-unit.sid-77f079fe516bfeb5acfac8e3ddbc7199"]},"form":"Löwen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"question","group":"source-use","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Учитель спрашивает, зачем духу львиная сила.","en":"The teacher asks why the spirit needs the lion’s power."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.02","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-1444d006a038716b06a33646bf0b0439","tos.text-unit.sid-1444d006a038716b06a33646bf0b0439"]},"form":"Löwe","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"source-use","neighbours":["creation","tablets-values","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Лев добывает свободу для нового созидания.","en":"The lion wins freedom for new creation."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.02","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-a25836b92a53f9f127019fa8fa725a25","tos.text-unit.sid-a25836b92a53f9f127019fa8fa725a25"]},"form":"Löwen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"source-use","neighbours":["creation","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Священное «нет» добывает свободу перед долгом.","en":"A sacred no wins freedom before duty."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.02","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-ac6059bf23968ca1320ca593f57ccf72","tos.text-unit.sid-ac6059bf23968ca1320ca593f57ccf72"]},"form":"Löwen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"source-use","neighbours":["will","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Лев завоёвывает свободу от своей любви к «ты должен».","en":"The lion wins freedom from its own love of duty."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.02","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-f9c4ff1773a49108cc92e6a5d92d12e9","tos.text-unit.sid-f9c4ff1773a49108cc92e6a5d92d12e9"]},"form":"Löwe","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"question","group":"source-use","neig