III.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-9c5adf2a26403a84dc5e97a6f1957d58","tos.text-unit.sid-9c5adf2a26403a84dc5e97a6f1957d58"]},"form":"Löwe","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"source-use","neighbours":["laughter","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Учитель ждёт смеющегося льва с голубями как знака часа.","en":"The teacher awaits the laughing lion with doves as his hour’s sign."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-234c170569580e56d10b6def6b14c643","tos.text-unit.sid-234c170569580e56d10b6def6b14c643"]},"form":"Löwen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"source-use","neighbours":["will","becoming","identity","joy-lust","innocence-play","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Познание радует того, в ком воля льва; утомившимся играют волны.","en":"Knowing delights lion-will; the weary are left to the waves."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.11","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-bfe5539571eb9d4f7c5bfec27f0da3a7","tos.text-unit.sid-bfe5539571eb9d4f7c5bfec27f0da3a7"]},"form":"Löwen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"source-use","neighbours":["courage","laughter","body-self","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Учитель ждёт сильнейших и веселейших смеющихся львов.","en":"The teacher awaits stronger and more cheerful laughing lions."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.13","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-434e8de54c342363657b753bb5675491","tos.text-unit.sid-090b6dc18e16b37e61206b4ed569fa7b"]},"form":"Löwinnen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"source-use","neighbours":["dance","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Свободный дух славится способностью танцевать на печали.","en":"The free spirit is praised for dancing on sorrow."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.16","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-560c8e1bc5e590cf6443e36f4cc8d830","tos.text-unit.sid-