m":"Löwe","speaker":"narrator","addressee":"","mode":"narration","use":"narration","group":"source-use","neighbours":["becoming","attention","earth"],"line":{"ru":"Лев прерывает выход высших людей из пещеры.","en":"The lion interrupts the higher men’s exit from the cave."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.20","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-3aed787db3bc681b14b7a606fac6fe70","tos.text-unit.sid-3aed787db3bc681b14b7a606fac6fe70"]},"form":"Löwe","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"source-use","neighbours":["child","becoming","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Приход льва открывает зрелость учителя и близость детей.","en":"The lion’s coming reveals the teacher’s ripeness and the children’s nearness."}}]}
